@startuml
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "App Expo\n(Sprint 2)" as App
participant "aircraft_track()" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

U -> App : selects aircraft
App -> API : GET /aircraft/{hex}/track?minutes=60
activate API
API -> API : validates hex and 1 <= minutes <= 1440
API -> DB : TRACK: SELECT ... FROM position\nWHERE hex = ? AND ts > now() - 60 min\nORDER BY ts
note right of DB : index (hex, ts DESC)
DB --> API : positions
API --> App : 200 [ {ts, lat, lon, altitude_ft, ...} ]
deactivate API
App -> U : draws line (colour by altitude)
@enduml
